# Shocker, Unshakable: "During your turn, Shocker has first strike" (so FirstStrike on Bot1's turn 3, not on Bot2's turn 4) and "When Shocker
# enters, he deals 2 damage to target creature and 2 damage to that creature's controller." On turn 3 Bot1 pays {4}{R}{R} with Black Lotus
# (RRR), Mox Ruby, Mox Jet and Gleemox. The trigger refuses a player and an artifact, and takes Bot2's Wall of Earth (0/6): it survives with
# exactly 2 damage (until cleanup), and Bot2, the creature's controller, goes from 20 to 18 while Bot1 stays at 20.

